{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "67efebd9-2c5b-86e4-a178-321c40443268",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T15:18:34-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luz Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:08-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:12-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I am looking for the housing office, the Naval base housing office. Is this that one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:18-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. The Navy housing office is a separate thing, it's run through the base."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:26-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. City Hall. So I call the wrong number, I am sorry. So sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:31-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, don't apologize, it happens all the time. Are you trying to reach them about a unit on base?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:38-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. I want to ask about the housing, the application. I search on my phone and this number come up. Maybe I read it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:17:47-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be the search mixed it up. I'd go to the base's own website, there's a housing page there, or call the main base operator and ask them to connect you to housing. They'll get you to the right desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:00-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Main base operator. Okay. Not the city, the base. The base operator, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:05-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. The base operator, and ask for housing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:09-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand, I think. Sorry again for bother you. I am just a little confuse which office is which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:16-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally understandable, there are a lot of offices. You're no bother at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:21-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Is good day to be indoors, with the weather like this, so I stay in and make the calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:28-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It sure is, stay warm. Good luck with it, okay? Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T15:18:32-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Bye bye."
    }
  ],
